- Subtle warm accents for links/hover: #8B6F47 or similar
- Borders/dividers: #E0DBD3

Typography:
- Headlines: Playfair Display, bold/editorial
- Body: Inter or DM Sans, clean and readable

Marquee animation:
- CSS-only infinite scroll using @keyframes
- 3 rows, alternating directions
- Smooth, no jank — use transform: translateX() for GPU acceleration

Mobile menu:
- Hamburger icon (CSS-only or minimal JS)
- Full-screen overlay with nav links
- Toggle with JS

