Nexora, Kinetic, Pinnacle, Streamline, Orbis, Lumina, Beacon, Prism, Zenith, Forge, Catalyst, Vertex, Horizon, Atlas, Meridian, Crest, Ember, Helix, Apex, Stratos, Vantage, Cirrus, Mosaic, Aether, More

That matches the task_input.json list. Good.

